        <mxCell id="notes" value="Notes&#xa;• Not scrapeable on EKS Auto Mode: CoreDNS (AWS-managed, no in-cluster endpoint, no CloudWatch); scheduler / controller-manager → CloudWatch only.&#xa;• AMG is query/visualisation only — no metric data stored in the AMG accounts.&#xa;• Separate live/non-live workspaces chosen over a single shared workspace: BU engineers need Edit to author (non-live), and to limit blast radius." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBE9E7;strokeColor=#D84315;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;dashed=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
